{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro-inspired <strong>Metroidvania set in a gothic fantasy castle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time is limited: <strong>if you cannot conquer the castle within 30 days, everything will be swallowed by darkness.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paladin <strong>Enoch</strong> sets out to investigate a tragic incident on the empire\u2019s frontier.<br>With the aid of Sister <strong>Rebecca</strong> and the church, he ventures into a castle transformed into another world, searching for the fate of four missing knights and their lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Castle</strong> faithfully delivers the essence of classic Metroidvania\u2014exploration, collection, and hidden areas unlocked by new abilities\u2014while introducing a unique twist: <strong>time management</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As dusk falls, the power of darkness grows and exploration becomes more perilous. Yet, doors open only at night, and defeating stronger enemies grants greater rewards.<br>But once midnight passes, beware: <strong>an unspeakable malice seizes the castle</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the <strong>30-day limit</strong>, can Enoch and Rebecca complete their mission?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a gothic castle, uncover hidden items, and challenge powerful bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a visually shifting world as <strong>time flows</strong> with day and night cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies change, paths open or close, and new routes appear depending on the hour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As days pass, the castle\u2019s inhabitants grow ever stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain and enhance <strong>five distinctive weapons</strong> with unique traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Bibles and Zodiac Stones</strong> to unlock divine powers and holy magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purify abandoned chapels and protect Sister Rebecca from relentless enemy assaults.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A hundred years is too soon!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/6c7469de1498c24bcf7c9df227214bef15ba4acd.jpg"},{"name":"Fallen Ambition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/b8bb067e6b5e40d1273bae49bb92cf5c93224998.jpg"},{"name":"Cry of Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/22da979573c57b6f57ee1f2d72433e17152238e0.jpg"},{"name":"Equal Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/662a7dcb44bd0d6d48158938be06a619cd9b25c6.jpg"},{"name":"Tarnished Ideal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/4940fd6543caa1ed5b533e404658b74083e1aea5.jpg"},{"name":"The End of Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/a5fecc98988d070f4206f1de3097dca7502410d5.jpg"},{"name":"Vain Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/155be86422456cb585044ee0c0bd336f87b2b5c1.jpg"},{"name":"Zodiac Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/712cb5324d4288354d97d389999cba843bff6bfd.jpg"},{"name":"Bible Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/1c96effe9b522127bad4ddff2e19bed1ed42a4a8.jpg"},{"name":"Weapon Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2889740/46fb43f49c0aef029746729f15eea9014dbfd9a3.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2889740?t=1760587236","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai